title: Antifaschiste Aktion
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: antifa_formed == 1 and iron_front_timer = 0
on-arrival: iron_front_timer = 7; month_actions += 1; rb_militarization_cost = 2 if rfb_militancy > 0.1 else rfb_militarization_cost = 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 3 if rfb_militancy > 0.25
card-image: img/iron_front.png
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs, antifascism

= Antifaschiste Aktion

Antifa is our new antifascist coordination front, serving as another arm of the KPD. It marks a shift, as the KPD now sees the Nazis as a larger threat than the SPD. How should we use the Iron Front?

[? if workers_kpd < 45 or workers_kpd < workers_nsdap or workers_kpd < workers_spd : Unfortunately, the Iron Front's effectiveness is dragged down by the SPD's unpopularity, as the SPD is no longer the dominant party among the workers. Many Reichsbanner members have left, and many workers are not interested. ?]

- @defense: Rally for defense against the fascists with the Reichsbanner.
- @pacifism: Rally for pacifism, against nationalism and war.
- @socialism: Rally in support of socialism as the only effective opposition to reactionaries.
- @plan: Rally around our economic plan as a practical solution to the economic crisis.
- @antisemitism
- @easy_discard

@defense
subtitle: -[+ rfb_militarization_cost +] resources
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_strength += 50; rfb_militancy += 0.05; spd_relation -= 5 if historical_mode

Antifaschiste Aktion rallies for the militant defense of the gains of the working class, strengthening the Roter Frontkampferbund.

[? if historical_mode : The SPD decries the militarization of the Reichsbanner and Iron Front, and its members are leaving the republican organization. ?]


@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5 if pacifism >= 3; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; unemployed_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4

Antifaschiste Aktion rallies against nationalism and war.

@socialism
on-arrival: socialism += 5*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 50; unemployed_kpd += 5*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 40; new_middle_kpd += 5*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 60

Antifaschiste Aktion rallies in support of socialism against dictatorship.

@plan
view-if: economic_plan > 0 
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 8*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 8*(1-dissent); new_middle_kpd += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); rural_kpd += 3*(1-dissent);

Our economic plan provides a seemingly reasonable alternative to the crisis at hand.

@antisemitism
title: Rally against antisemitism and in defense of Jewish Germans.
view-if: confronting_antisemitism > 1
on-arrival: nationalism -= 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); socialism +=5*(1-dissent); confronting_antisemitism += 1; workers_nsdap -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_nsdap -= 4*(1-dissent);

# TODO
The Nazis and other far-right political movements are increasingly turning their hatred against the Jewish community of Germany. Antifaschiste Aktion rallies in defense of individual Jews and the broader community against violence.
